Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_LAST_DOM,
  TPCDS.CUSTOMER.C_BIRTH_MONTH 
FROM 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.CUSTOMER 
  ON TPCDS.CUSTOMER.C_FIRST_SHIPTO_DATE_SK = TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.CUSTOMER.C_CUSTOMER_SK <= 57959 AND 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DOW <= 1


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.D_LAST_DOM AS "D_LAST_DOM",
  Q2.C_BIRTH_MONTH AS "C_BIRTH_MONTH" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q1,
  TPCDS.CUSTOMER AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.C_FIRST_SHIPTO_DATE_SK = Q1.D_DATE_SK) AND 
  (Q1.D_DOW <= 1) AND 
  (Q2.C_CUSTOMER_SK <= 57959)

Explain level:    Explain from section

